        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Naked and Famous, Residual Kid\n- Places: Auckland, New Zealand; Austin, Texas\n- Music releases: Box, Faces, Salsa\n\nFacts:\n- The Naked and Famous are an indie electronic band from Auckland, New Zealand, formed in 2007.\n- Residual Kid is an American rock band from Austin, Texas, formed in 2009.\n- Residual Kid released the EP \"Box\" in 2011, and it was recorded with an earlier lineup.\n- Residual Kid released the EP \"Faces\" in 2012, and it featured the band's current lineup.\n- Residual Kid released the EP \"Salsa\" in 2016.",
